{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07503","headline":"赠湘南渔父 · 刘长卿","name":"赠湘南渔父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君何所适，暮暮逢烟水。\n独与不系舟，往来楚云里。\n钓鱼非一岁，终日只如此。\n日落江清桂檝迟，纤鳞百尺深可窥。\n沈钩垂饵不在得，白首沧浪空自知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}